ies and operations.','MIT News — AI','mit_news_ai','2026-09-01 21:25:00.000000','2026-10-06 02:01:37.551916',0,NULL),(475,'Ila Kumar: Innovating with communities','https://news.mit.edu/2026/ila-kumar-innovates-with-communities-0901','The PhD student works to give young people an active role in shaping digital technologies that can support their own well-being.','MIT News — AI','mit_news_ai','2026-09-01 04:00:00.000000','2026-10-06 02:01:37.551916',0,NULL);
